{"step_index":240,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T00:54:43Z","content":"Click **Yes**!\n\n1. When the folder picker opens, select your **Downloads** folder (where your `RLCF Sunday Meeting Livestreaming - September 13, 2026.mp4` video is saved).\n2. Click **Select Folder** (or **OK**).\n\nDaVinci Resolve will scan the folder, find the video file, and immediately link all your timeline clips to it!\n\n---\n\n*(If you accidentally clicked \"No\" or \"Cancel\", don't worry: just look at the **Media Pool** in Resolve, right-click the clip with the red exclamation mark, select **Relink Selected Clips...**, and choose your **Downloads** folder).*","thinking":"DaVinci Resolve indicates a missing video clip. The software prompts for a new location. The correct action is to select \"Yes\" to search for the clip in a different directory. The Downloads folder should be selected when the file browser appears.\n\n\n"}
